# GEO-092 I19:主支端面頂副支側面 → V_CUT_PRIORITY
# 擋面擁有者優先級(副支 3)未嚴格小於自己(主支 2) → 拒絕
# 副支先以明寫 at 放在面內部(兩端懸空合法),主支再頂它 → 違規
surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 4000,0 4000,3000 0,3000
grid 1 on 1 u 2000
timber 1 20 20 role boundary
timber 2 20 20 role boundary
timber 3 3000 20 20 role secondary
timber 4 27 33 role primary
place 1 on 1 at-edge e0 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at-edge e2 -u +n
place 3 on 1 at 500 1500 +u +n
place 4 on 1 at-grid 1 u 0 through 2000 +v +n
